  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Foam Cutting</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Cut micro-flow channels into foam surface</li>\n<li>Grooves provide route for resin flow</li>\n<li>Automatic and manually fed machines</li>\n<li>Simultaneous cutting of up to 192 grooves</li>\n<li>Foam blocks up to 8 ft wide and 10 in thick (2438 mm x 254 mm)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Industrial Automation</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithium-winding-machine/\">Lithium Winding Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithiumcopper-laminator/\">Lithium/Copper Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/automated-end-capper/\">Automated End Capper</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/biological-assay/\">Biological Assay</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/cargo-lifter/\">Cargo Lifter</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/industrial-automation/foam-cutting/\">Foam Cutting</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/instrumented-fetal-model/\">Instrumented Fetal Model</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/spray-booth/\">Spray Booth</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/window-cell-manufacture/\">Window Cell Manufacture</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/hail-stone-machines/\">Hail Stone Machines</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-a-300x261.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"261\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-b-300x261.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"261\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Foam-Cutting-Machine-c.j